# GraphCountdown

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphCountdown } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphCountdown
  title="example"
  done={'done'}
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `to` | `Date | number | string` | `—` | — |
| `done?` | `string` | `'done'` | — |
| `caption?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphCountdownProps`
